    "description": "<p>So Speaks Kimbery permanently alters the costs and mechanics of the Infernal's Kimbery Excellency suite. The First Kimbery Excellency now provides two dice per mote spent rather than one, and the Second Kimbery Excellency now provides one automatic success per mote spent rather than one per two motes. Kimbery Inevitability Technique no longer requires a Willpower expenditure, costing four motes instead. So Speaks Kimbery is incompatible with Effortless Kimbery Dominance.</p>",
